			"Message": "feat(Wind): Add Tier 3 service implementations\n\nAdd the remaining VS Code service implementations to Wind's Effect-TS service layer, completing the service coverage:\n\n**New Services:**\n- StorageService: Persistent key-value store backed by Mountain's StorageProvider\n- NotificationService: Toast messages and progress indicators via UserInterfaceProvider\n- ProgressService: Progress reporting with location options (notification/statusBar/window)\n- QuickInputService: Quick pick and input box dialogs via blocking IPC pattern\n- WorkspacesService: Multi-folder workspace management\n- ThemesService: Color theme get/set/list operations\n- SearchService: Text and file search via native glob/grep\n\n**Changes:**\n- Integrate all new services into TauriBaseLayer and TauriLiveLayer compositions\n- Add IPC channel handlers for each new service (notification:*, progress:*, quickInput:*, search:*, storage:*, themes:*, workspaces:*)\n- Include Problem types for each service with proper discriminated union error handling\n- Add Stub and Mock implementations for testing\n\nAlso includes code formatting standardization across all Effect files (import ordering, line wrapping, consistent style) applied during the service implementation work.",
